    "description": "You ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> (including <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Total_Concealment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Concealment\">Total Concealment</a>) from darkness. However, you cannot perceive colors in total darkness. Additionally, at close range (within 10 squares), you ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> for purposes of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks, and take no penalty from poor visibility while <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tracking\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tracking\">Tracking</a>.",
